-- Expected computations of the interface improvements (2026-10-25).
-- Coordinate/entry defining equations explicitly decode function vectors
-- and column matrices. Mathematical clients do not reopen these accessors.
Alternating.Over.coordinate: Vec
Alternating.Over.coordinate-value: Vec coordinate Fin
Determinant.Over.entry: Vec Mat
Determinant.Over.entry-value: Vec Mat Fin entry
Determinant.Over.act-coordinate: Fin act Vec coordinate sum Mat entry
-- Generic alpha naturality checks the two composites once by uniqueness.
-- Bundled algebra-carrier decoding is deliberately left as an extra here.
ExteriorUniversal.Over.alpha-hom: eone
ExteriorUniversal.Over.grade-natural: comp alpha-hom
Determinant.Over.Map.value-zero:
Determinant.Over.Map.value-alpha: value
-- The standard extension's components, now named at its construction.
-- ext-precomp identifies this extension with identity; its graded component
-- gives the generator commutation law. Carrier encodings remain visible.
ExteriorContr.Over.standard-extension:
ExteriorContr.Over.standard-extension-id: standard-extension ext i idHom
ExteriorContr.Over.standard-extension-graded: standard-extension ext i idHom precomp Extension Graded Anti
ExteriorContr.Over.gen-commute:
ExteriorUniversal.Over.In.ext-precomp-value: Extension ext precomp
